STAAD PLANE SETTLEFRAME EXAMPLE CHECK
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Independent check of SettleFrame (CE 7405): 3-bay, 2-story example frame
* Units: kN, m.  Joint and member numbers match SettleFrame:
*   columns 1-4 = story 1 (F1..F4), columns 5-8 = story 2, beams 9-14
* Load 3 imposes the coupled settlements at t = 30 years from SettleFrame.
* Load 4 = sustained load D + 0.3L + settlement; its vertical reactions
* should equal SettleFrame's coupled footing loads at 30 years.
*
* SettleFrame results to compare (magnitudes):
*   Vertical reactions, load 1 (D):   137.5  312.5  312.5  137.5 kN
*   Vertical reactions, load 2 (L):    46.9  106.1  106.1   46.9 kN
*   Vertical reactions, load 3 (S):    72.2   73.9   62.9   64.6 kN
*                                      (F1, F4 up; F2, F3 down)
*   Vertical reactions, load 4:       223.8  270.4  281.4  216.2 kN
*   Load 1, beam 9 end moments:        58.4 (left)   100.2 (right) kN-m
*   Load 1, column 1 base moment:      11.7 kN-m
*   Load 3, beam 9 end moments:       122.7 (left)   128.5 (right) kN-m
*   Load 3, beam 11 end moments:      111.3 (left)   105.5 (right) kN-m
*   Load 3, column 5 end moments:      72.6 (bottom)  83.3 (top)   kN-m
* SET SHEAR below makes STAAD ignore shear deformation, as SettleFrame
* does (Euler-Bernoulli). Delete that line to see its effect.
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
SET SHEAR
UNIT METER KN
JOINT COORDINATES
1 0 0 0; 2 6 0 0; 3 12 0 0; 4 18 0 0;
5 0 4 0; 6 6 4 0; 7 12 4 0; 8 18 4 0;
9 0 7.5 0; 10 6 7.5 0; 11 12 7.5 0; 12 18 7.5 0;
MEMBER INCIDENCES
1 1 5; 2 2 6; 3 3 7; 4 4 8;
5 5 9; 6 6 10; 7 7 11; 8 8 12;
9 5 6; 10 6 7; 11 7 8;
12 9 10; 13 10 11; 14 11 12;
MEMBER PROPERTY
1 TO 8 PRIS YD 0.4 ZD 0.4
9 TO 14 PRIS YD 0.6 ZD 0.3
CONSTANTS
E 2.5E+07 ALL
POISSON 0.17 ALL
SUPPORTS
1 TO 4 FIXED
LOAD 1 DEAD LOAD D
MEMBER LOAD
9 TO 11 UNI GY -30
12 TO 14 UNI GY -20
LOAD 2 LIVE LOAD L
MEMBER LOAD
9 TO 11 UNI GY -12
12 TO 14 UNI GY -5
LOAD 3 SETTLEMENT AT 30 YEARS COUPLED
SUPPORT DISPLACEMENT LOAD
1 FY -0.00701
2 FY -0.02076
3 FY -0.02461
4 FY -0.01946
LOAD COMBINATION 4 SUSTAINED D + 0.3L + SETTLEMENT
1 1.0 2 0.3 3 1.0
PERFORM ANALYSIS
PRINT MEMBER FORCES
PRINT SUPPORT REACTION
FINISH
